# BOM

- Edit `bom/bom.csv` for every part add, qty change, or status change.
- Status values: `owned`, `recommended`, `optional`, `deferred`, `rejected`.
- Keep README schema in sync if you add columns.
- Owned prototype parts stay in the sheet; do not delete them when recommending replacements.
